# 🛠 SKILL — Audit Invariants

> **Authority**: caw:/minispace/.know/canon/CONTRACT.ail + ws:/AGENTS.md
> **Branch**: `go:/olym/k/cogninfer/skills/`
> **RRP**: `t:/gopia/olym/k/cogninfer/skills/audit-invariants.ail`

---

## SK-AI-1 — Principle

> **Auditor không tạo source. Auditor chỉ verify compliance.**

Mỗi Cogninfer Actor (đặc biệt Auditor) PHẢI kiểm tra MAY/MAY-NOT matrix
trước khi approve seal + push lên Distribution.

## SK-AI-2 — Per-layer Invariants

### Engine Parts (ha:/)

```yaml
engine_invariants:
  must_have:
    - "manifest.ail"
    - "fan-table.ail"
    - "Cargo.toml"
    - "src/lib.rs"
    - "src/amo.rs hoặc src/nep.rs"
    - "tests/"
    - "C-X-R zones (x/, r/, c/)"
  must_not_have:
    - "src/ bị override bởi workspace"
    - "Hardcoded credentials"
    - "Cargo.toml không có [package] metadata"
```

### Minispaces (caw:/)

```yaml
minispace_invariants:
  must_have:
    - "Cargo.toml với path-deps only"
    - "scripts/ orchestration"
    - "tests/ smoke integration"
    - "manifest.ail"
    - "README.md"
  must_not_have:
    - "src/ trong ws-*"
    - "crates/ trong ws-*"
    - "engine/ trong ws-*"
    - "vendor/ trong ws-*"
    - "[workspace] section trong ws-*/Cargo.toml"
    - "Modify ha:/engine/* từ caw context"
```

### Final Products (ws:/)

```yaml
workspace_invariants:
  must_have:
    - "AGENTS.md (workspace-specific)"
    - "README.md"
    - ".know/overview.ail"
    - "Integration tests PASS"
    - "Sign + verify artifact"
  must_not_have:
    - "Patch ha:/engine/* từ ws context"
    - "Patch caw:/ từ ws context"
    - "Skip integration test"
    - "Push unsealed artifact"
```

## SK-AI-3 — Recipe (PowerShell)

```powershell
# Audit script
function Invoke-Audit {
    param(
        [string]$Target,    # ha: | caw: | ws:
        [string]$Path       # local path
    )

    $results = @()
    switch ($Target) {
        "caw" {
            # Check no src/ in ws-*
            $srcDirs = Get-ChildItem -Path "$Path/ws-*" -Directory `
                -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Where-Object {
                Test-Path "$_/src"
            }
            if ($srcDirs.Count -gt 0) {
                $results += "VIOLATION: src/ in $($srcDirs.Name)"
            }

            # Check no crates/ in ws-*
            $cratesDirs = Get-ChildItem -Path "$Path/ws-*" -Directory `
                -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Where-Object {
                Test-Path "$_/crates"
            }
            if ($cratesDirs.Count -gt 0) {
                $results += "VIOLATION: crates/ in $($cratesDirs.Name)"
            }

            # Check no vendor/ in ws-*
            $vendorDirs = Get-ChildItem -Path "$Path/ws-*" -Directory `
                -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Where-Object {
                Test-Object "$_/vendor"
            }
            if ($vendorDirs.Count -gt 0) {
                $results += "VIOLATION: vendor/ in $($vendorDirs.Name)"
            }
        }
        "ha" {
            # Check Cargo.toml exists
            if (-not (Test-Path "$Path/Cargo.toml")) {
                $results += "VIOLATION: missing Cargo.toml"
            }
            # Check manifest.ail
            if (-not (Test-Path "$Path/manifest.ail")) {
                $results += "VIOLATION: missing manifest.ail"
            }
        }
        "ws" {
            # Check AGENTS.md
            if (-not (Test-Path "$Path/AGENTS.md")) {
                $results += "VIOLATION: missing AGENTS.md"
            }
            # Check README.md
            if (-not (Test-Path "$Path/README.md")) {
                $results += "VIOLATION: missing README.md"
            }
        }
    }

    return $results
}
```

## SK-AI-4 — Audit Report

```yaml
audit_report_format:
  audit_id: "<uuid>"
  target: "<ha | caw | ws>"
  target_path: "<fap path>"
  auditor_id: "<actor id>"
  timestamp: "<iso8601>"
  invariants_checked: <int>
  violations_found: <int>
  violations:
    - rule_id: "<R-CPF-N | R-AAM-N | R-SI-N>"
      severity: "<P0 | P1 | P2>"
      description: "<text>"
      fix_action: "<handoff target>"
  verdict: "<PASS | FAIL | CONDITIONAL>"
  next_action: "<approve_seal | block_release | require_fix>"
```

## SK-AI-5 — Verdict Logic

```yaml
verdict:
  PASS:
    condition: "0 violations"
    action: "approve_seal"
  CONDITIONAL:
    condition: "1+ P2 violations, 0 P0/P1"
    action: "require_fix (P2 không block release)"
  FAIL:
    condition: "1+ P0 hoặc P1 violations"
    action: "block_release + require_fix + handoff"
```

## SK-AI-6 — Severity Levels

```yaml
severity:
  P0:
    description: "Constitutional violation — block release"
    examples:
      - "Modify ha:/engine/* từ caw: hoặc ws: context"
      - "Push unsealed artifact"
      - "Skip integration test"
      - "Violate c/ constitution"
  P1:
    description: "Hard rule violation — block release"
    examples:
      - "src/ trong ws-*"
      - "vendor/ duplicate per-workspace"
      - "Cargo.toml thiếu [package]"
      - "AGENTS.md missing"
  P2:
    description: "Convention violation — require_fix"
    examples:
      - "README.md thiếu example"
      - "scripts/ thiếu một script"
      - "Commit message không đúng format"
```

